Sw. ''vattenledning'' = Dan. ''vandledning'', aqueduct); < ''water'' + ''leader''<sup>1</sup>.] A water-carrier.
{{smaller block|The cokis and ''watir-lederes.''
{{right|''York Plays'', p. 307.}}}}

